WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:02.600
welcome to the team as you get settled this week

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.333
you're gonna find co pilot genuinely useful

3
00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:08.500
handed a report and it reliably finds the structure

4
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.933
pulls the relevant points

5
00:00:09.966 --> 00:00:11.433
and delivers a really clean

6
00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:15.266
well formatted draft but you do have to verify it

7
00:00:15.266 --> 00:00:17.700
take this Q2 report output for example

8
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.666
it accurately pulled Oklahoma City

9
00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:21.600
and the 18,000 dollar cost

10
00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:24.700
but then it confidently and incorrectly

11
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.366
claimed a 74.4% on time rate

12
00:00:27.366 --> 00:00:29.600
and falsely blamed vehicle breakdowns

13
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.466
these errors slip through

14
00:00:31.466 --> 00:00:33.600
exactly because they're so plausible

15
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.466
they're well written

16
00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:36.366
and blend right in with the correct facts

17
00:00:36.366 --> 00:00:37.833
which makes them way harder to catch

18
00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:39.366
than just complete nonsense

19
00:00:39.866 --> 00:00:42.033
to catch these just take 30 seconds

20
00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.800
and cross check the source document

21
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.866
for three recurring error clusters

22
00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:47.100
check the numbers

23
00:00:47.266 --> 00:00:50.500
the superlatives like top cause or worst performer

24
00:00:50.566 --> 00:00:52.800
and any totals assembled from parts

25
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.000
ultimately accountability rests with us

26
00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:58.233
because a wrong number that reaches leadership

27
00:00:58.233 --> 00:00:59.900
well that's your wrong number

28
00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:02.400
regardless of which tool helped draft the email

29
00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:04.866
think of copilot as the writer

30
00:01:04.866 --> 00:01:06.366
but you are the editor

31
00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:09.300
next you will see this summary beside the real report

32
00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.266
flag the sentences you would check before sending it
